ANDROID: perf_event_open02: stabilization on Android

1. Increase the FP rounding error threshold from 0.0001 to 0.005 to allow
   for RT throttling overhead which is common in Android's CPU scheduler.
2. Move the sched_setscheduler call to setup to ensure RT priority is set
   early, and reset priority back to 0 in the main verification logic.

Test: atest vts_ltp_test_x86_64:syscalls.perf_event_open02_64bit

